  "engine": "fm",
  "comment": "Classic lo-fi hip-hop at 78 BPM with a lazy, heavy swing: muffled kick, soft snare and quiet shuffled hats on the Lo-Fi kit (Euclid), rootless ninth voicings on Dusty Keys with strong tape wow (Orbit lanes 1-3), a warm round bass on the roots (step sequencer), vinyl crackle (Orbit lane 4). Fm9 - Bb13 - Ebmaj9 - C7#9; dark master (low-pass, tape saturation). Press Play.",
